  "slug": "radish-and-cucumber-salad",
  "title": "Radish and Cucumber Salad",
  "blurb": "A crisp, refreshing salad with peppery radishes and cool cucumber, dressed simply with lemon and dill.",
  "steps": [
    "Trim the radishes and slice them thinly into rounds.",
    "Cut the cucumber lengthways into quarters, then slice each quarter into sticks about 5cm long.",
    "Put the radishes and cucumber into a serving bowl.",
    "Add the chopped dill, lemon juice, olive oil, salt and a good grinding of black pepper.",
    "Toss everything together gently with your hands or two spoons until the vegetables are evenly coated.",
    "Taste and add more salt or pepper if needed, then serve straight away."
